   "source": [
    "### 1.2. Déterminer une primitive numérique\n",
    "**Q.8**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "70c1deb8-bed9-445d-94aa-8f828f00561e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# paramètre du problème\n",
    "x = np.linspace(0, 10, 200)\n",
    "dx = x[1] - x[0]\n",
    "fp = 2*x\n",
    "f0 = 0\n",
    "\n",
    "# condition initiale\n",
    "f = np.zeros_like(fp)\n",
    "f[0] = f0\n",
    "\n",
    "# boucle tracé de f\n",
    "for i in range(1, len(x)):\n",
    "    f[i] = f[i-1] + fp[i]*dx\n",
    "\n",
    "# fonction théorique\n",
    "fth = x**2\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure()\n",
    "plt.plot(x,f, '+', label='Integrale numérique')\n",
    "plt.plot(x,fth, label=\"Intégrale théorique\")\n",
    "plt.plot(x,fp, label='Fonction dérivée')\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.grid()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "0c8f0281-67fe-48da-beed-e764023d0c38",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Créer votre code pour intégrer la fonction de Gauss si dessous : \n",
    "_ # à compléter"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b7b4c5ea-2235-4606-bce1-24fa0a7b1ecd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Discrétisation d'une équation différentielle\n",
    "\n",
    "Soit l'équation différentielle $y' + ay = b$ dont nous cherchons la solution numérique.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Q11 et Q12**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "7085b744-7b6f-474e-b50c-fe984495cdf3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# paramètres du problème\n",
    "dx = .05\n",
    "b = 4\n",
    "a = 3\n",
    "xmin = 0\n",
    "xmax = 4\n",
    "x = np.arange(start=xmin, stop=xmax, step=dx)\n",
    "\n",
    "# condition initiale\n",
    "y = np.zeros_like(x)\n",
    "y[0] = 6\n",
    "\n",
    "# détermination de y numérique pour tout x\n",
    "for i in range(1,len(x)):\n",
    "    y[i] = y[i-1] - dx*(a*y[i-1] - b)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# solution théorique de y_th\n",
    "yth = (-b/a + y[0])*np.exp(-a*x) + b/a\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# tracé des solution\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10,6))\n",
    "plt.plot(x,y, '+b', label='Solution numérique')\n",
    "plt.plot(x,yth, '-r', label='Solution théorique')\n",
    "plt.grid()\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "3475dda9-28a0-4fd6-8f96-a6828a0a2bd4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# récopier le code ci-dessus, et l'adapter pour pour résoudre l'équation différentielle demandée.\n",
